<a href="#S6.SS2.p1.1" title="6.2 Performance Comparison ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ ProxyFL: A Proxy-Guided Framework for Federated Semi-Supervised Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§6.2</span></a>,
<a href="#S6.SS3.p4.1" title="6.3 Empirical Analysis ‣ 6 Experiments ‣ ProxyFL: A Proxy-Guided Framework for Federated Semi-Supervised Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§6.3</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Definitions of Data Heterogeneity in FSSL</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We define data heterogeneity in FSSL as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 1</span></span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(External heterogeneity in FSSL)</span><span id="Thmdefinition1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> External heterogeneity refers to the distribution discrepancy between <math id="Thmdefinition1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> across different clients <math id="Thmdefinition1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathcal{C}_{1},\ldots,\mathcal{C}_{K}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathcal{C}_{1},\ldots,\mathcal{C}_{K}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <em id="Thmdefinition1.p1.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_upright">i.e.</em>, for any two different clients <math id="Thmdefinition1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{k_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{k_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmdefinition1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{k_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{k_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Thmdefinition1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{k_{1}}(\mathbf{Y}){\neq}\mathcal{P}_{k_{2}}(\mathbf{Y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{k_{1}}(\mathbf{Y}){\neq}\mathcal{P}_{k_{2}}(\mathbf{Y})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 2</span></span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Internal heterogeneity in FSSL)</span><span id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> Internal heterogeneity exists within local clients, embodied in: 1) class imbalance, arising from unequal sample sizes among different categories within <math id="Thmdefinition2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math>, <em id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_upright">i.e.</em>, for any two categories <math id="Thmdefinition2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmdefinition2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Thmdefinition2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{k}(\mathbf{Y}({c_{1}})){\neq}\mathcal{P}_{k}(\mathbf{Y}({c_{2}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{k}(\mathbf{Y}({c_{1}})){\neq}\mathcal{P}_{k}(\mathbf{Y}({c_{2}}))</annotation></semantics></math>; 2) distribution imbalance between labeled and unlabeled data, i.e., <math id="Thmdefinition2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{k}^{\texttt{{s}}}(\mathbf{Y}){\neq}\mathcal{P}_{k}^{\texttt{{u}}}(\mathbf{Y})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">s</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">u</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{k}^{\texttt{{s}}}(\mathbf{Y}){\neq}\mathcal{P}_{k}^{\texttt{{u}}}(\mathbf{Y})</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Pseudo-Code</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The pseudo-code of ProxyFL is shown in Algorithm. <a href="#algorithm1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix B Pseudo-Code ‣ ProxyFL: A Proxy-Guided Framework for Federated Semi-Supervised Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Proxy-Guided FSSL (ProxyFL)</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.6.1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="algorithm1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>
Federation system <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ℂ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{C}</annotation></semantics></math>,
communication round <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>,
local learning rate <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>, global model <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝚯</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="algorithm1.6.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><em id="algorithm1.6.2.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;"><math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t=0\to T-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t=0\to T-1</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="algorithm1.6.2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Randomly sample a subset of clients </span><math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{C}_{M}\subseteq\mathbb{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℂ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊆</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℂ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{C}_{M}\subseteq\mathbb{C}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="algorithm1.6.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">foreach</span><span id="algorithm1.6.4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><em id="algorithm1.6.4.5" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">client <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{m}\in\mathbb{C}_{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>ℂ</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{m}\in\mathbb{C}_{M}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.6.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">in parallel</span></em><span id="algorithm1.6.4.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Initialize </span><math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝚯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> via </span><math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝚯</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> from server;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.6" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.6.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Calculate </span><math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{s}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">s</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{s}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{u}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">u</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{u}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> on </span><math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{x}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.6.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}^{\texttt{{hc}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐮</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">hc</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}^{\texttt{{hc}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.6.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> via Eq. </span><a href="#S5.Ex4" title="In 5.3 Loss Functions ‣ 5 Methodology ‣ ProxyFL: A Proxy-Guided Framework for Federated Semi-Supervised Learning" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a><span id="algorithm1.6.6.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Calculate </span><math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{ICPL}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">ICPL</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{ICPL}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> on </span><math id="algorithm1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}^{\texttt{{hc}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐮</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">hc</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}^{\texttt{{hc}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> and </span><math id="algorithm1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}^{\texttt{{lc}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐮</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">lc</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}^{\texttt{{lc}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> via Eq. </span><a href="#S5.E8" title="Equation 8 ‣ 5.2.2 Positive-Negative Proxy Pool ‣ 5.2 Indecisive-Categories Proxy Learning ‣ 5 Methodology ‣ ProxyFL: A Proxy-Guided Framework for Federated Semi-Supervised Learning" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a><span id="algorithm1.6.7.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.8" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.8.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{local}}}\leftarrow\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{s}}}+\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{u}}}+\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{ICPL}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">local</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">s</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">u</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">ICPL</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{local}}}\leftarrow\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{s}}}+\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{u}}}+\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{ICPL}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.9" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.9.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t}-\eta_{l}\nabla_{\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t}}\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{local}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝚯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝚯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝚯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup></msub><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">ℒ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">local</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t}-\eta_{l}\nabla_{\mathbf{\Theta}_{m}^{t}}\mathcal{L}_{\texttt{{local}}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.10" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.10.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  end foreach</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.11" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.11.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}{\leftarrow}\sum_{\mathcal{C}_{m}\in\mathbb{C}_{M}}\gamma_{m}\theta_{m}^{t+1},\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}{\leftarrow}\sum_{\mathcal{C}_{m}\in\mathbb{C}_{M}}\gamma_{m}\omega_{m}^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒞</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℂ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝛀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒞</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℂ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ω</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}{\leftarrow}\sum_{\mathcal{C}_{m}\in\mathbb{C}_{M}}\gamma_{m}\theta_{m}^{t+1},\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}{\leftarrow}\sum_{\mathcal{C}_{m}\in\mathbb{C}_{M}}\gamma_{m}\omega_{m}^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.12" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm1.6.12.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Server optimizes the global proxy </span><math id="algorithm1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝛀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> via Eq. </span><a href="#S5.E2" title="Equation 2 ‣ 5.1 Global Proxy Tuning ‣ 5 Methodology ‣ ProxyFL: A Proxy-Guided Framework for Federated Semi-Supervised Learning" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a><span id="algorithm1.6.12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
</span><math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}\;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝛀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝛀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}\leftarrow\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}\;</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.12.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, thus </span><math id="algorithm1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}=\theta_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}\cup\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝚯</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∪</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝛀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒢</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}=\theta_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}\cup\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}^{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm1.6.12.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;
</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.13" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">end for</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.6.14" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.6.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">return</span><span id="algorithm1.6.14.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><em id="algorithm1.6.14.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;"><math id="algorithm1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}^{T}=\theta_{\mathcal{G}}^{T}\cup\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝚯</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo>∪</mo><msubsup><mi>𝛀</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\Theta}_{\mathcal{G}}^{T}=\theta_{\mathcal{G}}^{T}\cup\mathbf{\Omega}_{\mathcal{G}}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="algorithm1.6.14.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
</div>
